# Input

```scss
@use "sass:map";
@use "sass:list";

$gap: 8px; $a: -$gap; $b: +$gap; $c: not false; $d: 1 < 2;
.case-assignment-operands { minus:$a; plus:$b; negated:$c; comparison:$d; }

$gap: 8px; @function identity($x) { @return $x; }
.case-call-operands { minus:identity(-$gap); plus:identity(+$gap); negated:identity(not false); comparison:identity(1 < 2); }

```


# Formatted

```scss
@use "sass:map";
@use "sass:list";

$gap: 8px;
$a: -$gap;
$b: +$gap;
$c: not false;
$d: 1 < 2;
.case-assignment-operands {
	minus: $a;
	plus: $b;
	negated: $c;
	comparison: $d;
}

$gap: 8px;
@function identity($x) {
	@return $x;
}
.case-call-operands {
	minus: identity(-$gap);
	plus: identity(+$gap);
	negated: identity(not false);
	comparison: identity(1 < 2);
}

```
